title: The Leipzig Congress
subtitle: The Eighth Party Congress meets. The Left wants the leadership.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: time >= 2 and year = 1923
max-visits: 1

= The Eighth Party Congress, Leipzig

The congress meets in Leipzig at the turn of January and February. The main fight is over the "workers' government". The leadership says joint governments with the left <span class="p-spd">SPD</span>, as in Saxony, can lead the working class toward power. The Berlin and Hamburg Left says they are coalitions with reformists that will disarm the revolution.

The party must adopt a resolution. Then the delegates elect the new Zentrale.

- @bridge
- @compromise
- @reject

@bridge
title: The workers' government is a bridge to the <span class="p-spd">SPD</span>'s workers.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-right">Right</span>. Angers the <span class="f-left">Left</span> and <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {right: 5, left: -4, ultra: -3});
Q.spd_relation += 3;
!}
go-to: result

@compromise
title: The workers' government is only a step toward the dictatorship of the proletariat.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>. Calms the factions.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {center: 4, left: 1});
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 5; }
!}
go-to: result

@reject
title: No coalitions with reformists, in any state.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-left">Left</span>, <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span> and <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>. Angers the <span class="f-right">Right</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 5, ultra: 2, stalin: 2, right: -5});
Q.spd_relation -= 4;
!}
go-to: result

@result
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.normalize(Q);
window.RF.congress(Q);
!}

= The vote

[? if congress_compromise : No faction can command a majority. The delegates settle on the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span> as a compromise leadership. ?][? if congress_compromise = 0 : The delegates give the <span class="f-[+ congress_winner +]">[+ congress_winner_name +]</span> the majority. ?]

[? if moscow_overruled : Then the <span class="p-comintern">Comintern</span>'s representatives intervene. Moscow will not accept the [+ overruled_name +] as leadership, and the new Zentrale is formed from the <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>. ?]

The <span class="p-kpd">KPD</span> is now led by the <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>.
